WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:04.166
- (Speaking in foreign language)

00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:12.997
(light electronic piano music)

00:00:21.508 --> 00:00:23.053
- [Narrator] At only 24 years old,

00:00:23.053 --> 00:00:25.874
Guirec Soudee is aboard
a 30-foot boat sailing

00:00:25.874 --> 00:00:29.316
around the world completely on his own.

00:00:29.316 --> 00:00:33.399
- (Speaking in foreign language)

00:00:45.282 --> 00:00:46.517
- [Narrator] He left his home in France

00:00:46.517 --> 00:00:49.408
two and a half years ago
to begin his journey.

00:00:49.408 --> 00:00:53.491
- (Speaking in foreign language)

00:01:21.725 --> 00:01:23.520
- [Narrator] Although he's
been navigating alone,

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:26.005
he's found an unlikely companion.

00:01:26.005 --> 00:01:30.088
- (Speaking in foreign language)

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:37.523
(light violin music)

